OL,3,GNEWSAThousands of NHS and school staff 
OL,4,Ause cheaper buses                      
OL,6,FThousands of NHS and school staff have 
OL,7,Fsigned up to a new scheme offering them
OL,8,Ffree parking and discounted bus travel.
OL,10,FMoney collected from Oxford's temporary
OL,11,Fcongestion charge, which ended in      
OL,12,FSeptember, has been used to fund the   
OL,13,Finitiative.                            
OL,15,FIt entitles NHS and school staff       
OL,16,Fworking in the city to 16 hours free   
OL,17,Fparking each day at Oxford's five park 
OL,18,Fand ride sites, as well as subsidised  
OL,19,F#1 single bus tickets.                 
