OL,3,GNEWSAThousands of NHS and school staff 
OL,4,Ause cheaper buses                      
OL,6,FOxfordshire County Council's transport 
OL,7,Fchief Gareth Epps said he was          
OL,8,F"delighted by the take-up so far" for  
OL,9,Fthe scheme, with more than 2,000 people
OL,10,Fhaving used it.                        
